{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25472","headline":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 双碧潭 · 李德裕","name":"春暮思平泉杂咏二十首 双碧潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清剡与严湍，潺湲皆可忆。\n适来玩山水，无此秋潭色。\n莫辨幽兰丛，难分翠禽翼。\n迟迟洲渚步，临眺忘餐食。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}